{"code":"049830","name":"승일","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"포장재","sector_desc":"종이·플라스틱·유리 포장재. 내수 소비와 원재료 가격의 영향을 받는 방어적 업종입니다.","desc":"동사는 1961년 관 및 금속포장용기 제조판매업을 영위할 목적으로 설립되었으며, 2001년 코스닥시장에 상장하였음. 2008년 관계사였던 우성제관을 합병하여 일반관 부문을 주요 사업부문으로 확장하였음. 주요 사업은 제관업으로, 에어졸관은 화장품, 살충제, 생활용품 등을 OEM 방식으로 납품하고 있으며, 일반관은 식관, 공업용관, 참기름관 등 다양한 품목을 생산하여 CJ, GS칼텍스 등 국내 대기업에 공급하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-20","n_days":299,"close":6430.0,"open":6390.0,"high":6440.0,"low":6310.0,"volume":1749,"amount":11246070.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":-0.6221,"range_pct":2.0218,"ret_5":-0.4644,"ret_20":0.9419,"ret_60":1.2598,"ret_120":-14.2667,"ret_250":-26.2615,"ma20":6499.0,"ma60":6426.1667,"ma120":6626.8333,"ma200":7108.35,"close_vs_ma200":-9.543,"close_vs_ma60":0.0597,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":13.1662,"r2_60":0.2082,"slope_120":-23.5959,"r2_120":0.4803,"slope_250":-34.0797,"r2_250":0.9244,"high52":9800.0,"low52":5760.0,"pos_52w":16.5842,"dd_52w":-34.3878,"mdd_1y":-34.8243,"atr14_pct":6.9429,"vol_ann_60":26.7213,"vol_avg20":888.35,"vol_ratio20":1.9688,"vr5":0.6151,"vr20":0.3397,"amount_avg5":6403444.0,"amount_avg20":5741158.5,"amount_avg60":7417999.8333,"obv_chg20":-18.3374,"turnover_20":0.2897,"pv_eff_20":3.2509,"rsi14":47.9859,"frgn_net_5":299.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0049,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0049,"frgn_net_20":195.0,"inst_net_20":8.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0032,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0001,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0033,"frgn_net_60":1889.0,"inst_net_60":2027.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0308,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0331,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0639,"frgn_net_120":4155.0,"inst_net_120":2188.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0678,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0357,"smart_net_120_pct":0.1034,"foreign_ratio":0.9,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.12,"smart_buy_streak":5,"op_income_q":20.0,"op_margin_q":4.8309,"op_qoq":400.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":42.8571,"rev_yoy":12.5,"op_trend_4q":62.8571,"fin_period":"202606","roe":2.1,"debt_ratio":24.95,"per":12.39,"pbr":0.25,"div_yield":2.33,"foreign_rate"